      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَادَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A single locust:</i> (K: [if so, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَادٌ</span></b>  probably signifies <i>locusts;</i> as a coll. gen. n.:]) or <i>a
female locust.</i> (S, O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>A state,</i> or <i>condition.</i> (S, O, K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ فِى عَرَادَةِ خَيْرٍ</span>
<i>Such a one is in a good state,</i> or <i>condition.</i>
(S, O.)

